  :adr/consequences
  ["Applications and LLMs use one Datomic EDN query grammar across storage providers."
   "D1 remains a distinct backend rather than being mislabeled PostgreSQL or merged with embedded SQLite."
   "Authentication and authorization stay at the Worker boundary and do not become storage or query semantics."
   "CID heads replace numeric Datomic basis/tx identity; unsupported product features remain explicit."
   "Production qualification still requires cold/index-pruned reads, folding policy, load tests, and a permanent protected route."
