  :adr/canonical-markdown
  "90-docs/adr/2607265000-kotobase-d1-datomic-edn-api.md"
  :adr/body
  "D1-backed Kotobase now composes the provider-neutral immutable-block/conditional-ref contract with the same ClojureScript engine used by other providers. `kotobase.datomic` accepts Datomic's EDN transaction/query grammar and argument order; the Worker transports EDN rather than inventing a JSON query DSL. Every request is separately authenticated with signed CACAO and authorized by capability plus tenant-ref scope. The compatibility claim covers grammar and the documented query subset, not Datomic product features such as numeric basis-t, tempids, transactor/log/listener APIs, or complete scalar/schema semantics. Local workerd+D1 and remote Cloudflare D1 passed the authenticated transact/query/pull/datoms/retract/head suite. The public verification Worker was deleted afterward; D1 data, migrations, source, and redeploy scripts remain."
  :adr/source-format "edn"}]

